{"id":"wb-6-636","name":"沁阳北大寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"沁阳北大寺","text":"沁阳北大寺为位于中华人民共和国河南省沁阳市一座清真寺，由男寺和北寺两部分组成。沁阳北大寺始建年代不详，明万历八年重建，清朝增建，为河南省规模较大、保存完整的伊斯兰教建筑群。2006年被公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%81%E9%98%B3%E5%8C%97%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":84932461,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84932461","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/23787fa05e6ee9341c0e418e.jpg","title":"20240824_Qinyang_North_Mosque_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240824_Qinyang_North_Mosque_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/20240824_Qinyang_North_Mosque_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​沁阳北大寺","width":320,"height":213}}